WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.970
Let's get your first lesson online.

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:07.350
Local Encoder prepares your videos on your own computer, then sends them to AVideo.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.290
Start with your site's address and an account with upload permission.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.590
We'll skip the password entry here.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Password entry omitted. The next chapter starts connected.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.960
Once you're connected, choose Files and select your video.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.280
Add a clear title and description.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.220
The default settings take care of the technical choices.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.400
Then, click Add to queue.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.850
Ready? Select Add to queue.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.180
Now, Local Encoder handles the preparation for you, using your computer's processing power.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.360
You can follow each stage right here.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.940
Keep the app open and your computer running.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.660
Even at ninety-nine percent, the site may still be confirming the upload.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.040
Wait for Sent, and The video is on your site.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Still sending? Wait for the site to confirm completion.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:01.680
There it is.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.360
Your lesson is on the site.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.960
Select Open video to take a look.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.850
Select Open video to review your lesson.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.190
And here's the result, playing on AVideo.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:17.450
Before sharing, use Edit on site to check the title, preview image, and viewing access.

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:20.290
Your lesson is ready for that final review.
